# --- Original game: never commit ---------------------------------------------
# The original files of Tank Wars are copyrighted. Keep them locally in
# gamedata/ (see README); the private repository kaaasi/bomb-referenz holds them.
gamedata
# Folders for anything taken from the original (files, save games, screenshots, video frames, listings).
# Such material may only ever be placed in these folders or outside the working tree (AGENTS.md, rule 2.1);
# file names cannot protect it, because renamed configurations and screenshots look like any other file.
/original/
/referenz/
/aufnahmen/
/capture/
/bilder/
/videos/
/analyse/
# Exact names of the original package and the files the original writes, wherever they are placed.
# Deliberately no wildcards after "BOMB": own files such as BombRedone.ico must stay addable.
